    purse 20 45
    stay 90 160
    patience 25
    need Thirst 0.9 45
    need Hunger 0.6 30
    need Rest 0.5 20
    need Boredom 0.3 10
    need Grime 0.15 10
    dislike map Noise greater 10 0.004
    dislike map CO2 greater 12 0.004
    like map Comfort greater 2 0.001
    map Noise out 0.4
    map CO2 out 0.25
